    "primaryWitnesses": [
      {
        "ref": "NUM 16:1",
        "textualBasisJa": "Now Korah, the son of Izhar, the son of Kohath, the son of Levi, with Dathan and Abiram, the sons of Eliab, and On, the son of Peleth, sons of Reuben, took some men."
      },
      {
        "ref": "NUM 16:12",
        "textualBasisJa": "Moses sent to call Dathan and Abiram, the sons of Eliab; and they said, “We won’t come up!"
      },
      {
        "ref": "NUM 16:24",
        "textualBasisJa": "“Speak to the congregation, saying, ‘Get away from around the tent of Korah, Dathan, and Abiram!’”"
      },
      {
        "ref": "NUM 16:25",
        "textualBasisJa": "Moses rose up and went to Dathan and Abiram; and the elders of Israel followed him."
      },
      {
        "ref": "NUM 16:27",
        "textualBasisJa": "So they went away from the tent of Korah, Dathan, and Abiram, on every side. Dathan and Abiram came out, and stood at the door of their tents with their wives, their sons, and their little ones."
      },
      {
        "ref": "NUM 26:9",
        "textualBasisJa": "The sons of Eliab: Nemuel, Dathan, and Abiram. These are that Dathan and Abiram who were called by the congregation, who rebelled against Moses and against Aaron in the company of Korah when they rebelled against the LORD;"
      },
      {
        "ref": "NUM 16:31",
        "textualBasisJa": "As he finished speaking all these words, the ground that was under them split apart."
      }
    ],
